# Stata scratch
*.smcl
practica/**/lab-project/output/

# Logs written by `log using` inside a do-file are published outputs. Batch-mode
# logs print the Stata license banner and serial number and are never committed.
!setup/readiness/readiness_expected_output.log
!practica/**/build/output/*.log

# Planning, verification logs, graded problem-set solutions, and answer keys
# live in the private course repository (~/macro/local_projections/course-private),
# never here (editor decision D54).
lectures/*/BRIEF.md
lectures/*/VERIFY-*.md
lectures/*/EDIT-log.md
practica/*/VERIFY-*.md
practica/*/lab-project/solution/
